WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
- Is it, is it true that you got

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.430
in trouble for showering
at a gas station once?

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.823
'Cause I need the story.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.920
- It nearly got me arrested. That's true.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.060
I was traveling around America
as a young, young traveler.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.560
I was about 20-21 at the
time and I just slept

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.060
in my car because I couldn't
find a room that night.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.310
And I went to freshen up
in the morning, Kelly,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.440
as you do. And I couldn't
find a shower anywhere,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.670
but I found a gas station that was closed

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.030
and I realized that, you
know, well, the tap is there

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.430
and I'll just kind of try
and freshen up onto the tap.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:39.010
So I was sitting on the
ground, on the concrete trying

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.551
to freshen up. I want
to say I was clothed,

00:00:41.551 --> 00:00:42.603
I just wanna say it, I was clothed, okay?

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:46.610
And I wanted to get my head underneath.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.460
And as a lot of tall people struggle

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.050
with when you're staying in a cheap hotel,

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.490
when the force that doesn't
quite make, you know,

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.470
you've got to do that thing
where you kind of bend

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.040
down and get underneath.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.026
- [Kelly] I wouldn't know.

00:00:57.026 --> 00:00:59.719
- And I was trying to do that to-

00:00:59.719 --> 00:01:01.753
- I'm 5'3, so.

00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:05.390
- It has its advantages
when you're on the road,

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:06.740
Kelly, as you know.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.933
- Yeah. So it is nice.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.400
- So I was literally, you know, in a kind

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.760
of contortionist position under this tap

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.960
and someone in an apartment
building next door yelled out,

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.450
you know, "You can't do that,
sir. You can not take a shower

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.740
under a tap," and called the police.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.957
And the police came and
my excuse was, I said,

00:01:25.957 --> 00:01:27.960
"I'm sorry, but I'm Australian.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.590
And I don't have anywhere to..."

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:31.800
Anyway, I didn't get arrested, Kelly.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.952
And I can't remember if
I found a shower that day

00:01:35.952 --> 00:01:38.480
or not actually, but there you go.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.080
- Hey, I have several experiences.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:43.450
It wasn't in public, but
my place burned down here

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.350
in LA when I was a
teenager moved down here,

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.320
and I had nowhere to go,
but I had a gym membership.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.990
So I think they started
noticing I was taking showers

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:54.810
and like getting ready
for my job. I was like-

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.060
- She's skipping the workout.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.330
She's coming in for the shower,

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.690
but I didn't see the bit where-

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:00.000
- I wasn't working out-
- We saw this.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.410
- I was just showing up, you
know , around opening time

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:06.203
to get ready for, yeah. Hey,
you have to do what works.

